{"id": "153", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a child with short hair stood at the table and snorted to the man beside him, who giggled with amusement. Behind her, the woman lay on the sofa watching.", "pred": "A baby in a pink outfit sits on a table, reaching out while a woman behind her tries to get her attention, and the baby makes cooing sounds followed by laughter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "A baby in a pink outfit sits on a table, reaching out while a woman behind her tries to get her attention, and the baby makes cooing sounds followed by laughter.", "cot": "[\"A baby in a pink outfit sits on a table, reaching out while a woman behind her tries to get her attention, and the baby makes cooing sounds followed by laughter.\", \"A baby in a pink outfit sits on a table, looking up with a curious expression, while someone in the background makes playful sounds and laughter is heard.\", \"A baby plays with a table while a woman laughs and coos in the background.\", \"A baby is sitting on a table, moving its arms, and someone behind the table is making cooing sounds.\"]", "time_sec": 11.195, "generation_time_seconds": 9.5527, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [32, 8770, 304, 264, 18217, 27303, 23011, 389, 264, 1965, 11, 18739, 700, 1393, 264, 5220, 4815, 1059, 16297, 311, 633, 1059, 6529, 11, 323, 279, 8770, 3643, 1062, 78, 287, 10362, 8110, 553, 42114, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0702, -0.0122, -1.0685, -0.0435, -0.0167, -0.1049, -0.6727, -0.2627, -0.0789, -0.7011, -0.4441, -2.0556, -0.5285, -0.6972, -0.1048, -0.0107, -1.8273, -0.5482, -9.8208, -0.0001, -1.5469, -0.0397, -0.001, -0.7854, -0.3862, -0.9068, -0.1759, -0.1671, -0.3134, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1839, -3.8878, 0.0, -0.0461, -0.0007, -0.0002], "cumulative_logprob": -27.5098, "norm_logp": -0.7435,